OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with further outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain, but turning generally lighter
OL,9,Fand more patchy as winds ease
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FIt will stay cloudy with
OL,13,Ffurther outbreaks of rain, mostly
OL,14,Flight and patchy in the morning, but
OL,15,Fsome heavier bursts possible in the
OL,16,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
