OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FCloudy clearing Thursday morning. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of Thursday and Friday will
OL,8,Fbe dry and bright but chilly. Dry,
OL,9,Fbright start on Saturday, cloud and
OL,10,Frain possible from west later.
